t www.medicalrealities.com to access the Virtual Reality medical training platform Medical Realities.\n\nWhat is Medical Realities?\nMedical Realities is an award-winning Virtual Reality education platform for medical students, surgical trainees, surgeons, and health care professionals. Our mission is to revolutionize surgical training across the globe. \n\nModules\nThe platform offers a comprehensive collection of surgical operations covering key syllabus material and includes assessment. Each module allows immersive learning with full interactive features including anatomy and pathophysiology.\n\n360\u00b0 Video\nWe have captured high-quality 360\u00b0 video of real operations. Immerse yourself as you learn.\n\nInteractive\nOur content is richly interactive allowing you to test yourself and chart your progress.", "short_description": "Medical Realities is an award-winning education platform for surgical trainees."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.medicalrealities.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.medicalrealities.com/", "publisher_name": "Medical Realities", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.medicalrealities.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "429122985664037"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162753_1503125006472048_8545946584926388224_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x36